<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<worksheet component = "cur" xml:id = "wksht-graph-sketching" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
    <title>Graph Sketching</title>

    <introduction>
        <p>
            <ul>
                <li><title>Dates</title>
                    <p>Assigned Date: November 17, 2026</p>
                    <p>Due Date: November 24, 2026</p>
                </li>
                <li><title>Objective</title>
                    <p>
                        In this assignment, you will work through various types of graph sketching problems to learn how to analyze the graph of a function using the derivative. Take your time and lay out all of the information for the problem before you try to draw the graph. Use the included organizers and axes to collect the information and draw the graph. 
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </p>
    </introduction>

    <page>
        <paragraphs>
            <title>Shape of Graphs</title>
            
